[00:18.53] Rosalie
[00:22.28] I've been waiting all evening
[00:26.95] Possibly years I don't know
[00:36.74] Counting the passing hours
[00:41.10] Everything merges with the night
[00:54.69] I stand on the beach
[00:59.12] Giving out descriptions
[01:03.98] Different for everyone I see
[01:12.65] Since I just can't remember
[01:17.03] Longer than last September.
[01:30.61] Santiago
[01:35.02] Under the volcano
[01:39.99] Floats like a cushion on the sea
[01:48.97] Yet I can never sleep here
[01:53.45] Everything ponders in the night.
[02:43.44] Rosalie
[02:47.71] We've been talking all summer
[02:52.05] Picking the straw from our clothes
[03:01.70] See how the breeze has softened
[03:06.18] Everything pauses in the night.
